			"Message": "style(Eliminate): Add blank lines between struct fields and mod declarations\n\nInsert empty lines to separate struct fields in CLI.rs, Definition.rs, and Count.rs, and to separate module declarations in mod.rs files. Align with the project's formatting conventions where logical groupings within struct definitions and module lists are visually separated.\n\nAll Eliminate transform tests pass with the restructured formatting.",
