			"Message": "docs(Maintain): Update Rust API documentation submodule pin\n\nAdvance the `Documentation/Rust` submodule from 03179b59 to 71c8206d in the RustDocumentationMaintainLand repository. The new pin captures three commits of regenerated rustdoc HTML output covering the Build, Eliminate, CLI, and Architecture modules.\n\nNet change: 362 files, +4951/−1426 lines across API doc pages for `Maintain::Build`, `Maintain::Eliminate`, and their respective CLI and Definition sub-modules.",
			"SHA": "46346ee43eddeea0b8723ba7bf0b30b75c4c16d9"
